  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">VOICES CONNECTED &amp; AMPLIFIED</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is YGOAL&apos;s project extension on L&lt;(&gt;&amp;&lt;)&gt;L. The project serves as the Linking and Learning facilitation/platform for the extension phase of Voice in the Philippines. The aim of the project is to build the Voice community and foster meaningful collaborationamong partners rooted in values of inclusion and intersectionality.

Recognizing the challenges that rapidly emerged in 2020, YGOAL believes that the work of sustaining a community that will push for inclusive participation will be more challenging. Butit is a journey that YGOAL is eager to embrace. Being  the  Linking  and  Learning  facilitator  in  the  Philippines  for  the  past  two  yearsgave  YGOAL  the experience  to  dive  deeper  into  the  complex  issues of  the  rightsholder  groups.

PROPOSED METHODOLOGIES FOR THE COMPLETION OF PROJECT REQUIREMENTS

The following proposed methodologies integrate YGOAL&#x2019;s existing mechanisms for partners looking to
expand the reach of the community through partnership building, amplification, and capacity
strengthening. For the Linking and Learning Facilitation project, the methodologies below will be
implemented to ensure the delivery of targets:

1. YGOAL will maximize all voice grantees (cohort 1-2) in the process of engagement and
communitybuilding

2. YGOAL will use its partners and networks to create a communities of practice, communities of
stakeholders, and a learning community. Through YGOAL&#x2019;s established and continuing working
relationships with various organizations forging partnerships and/or endorsing the project is
easier and more accessible.

3. YGOAL will maximize the use of its online communities and pages to amplify the message of
inclusion nationwide. The efficiency and effectiveness of this process have been proventime and
again with YGOAL&#x2019;s various project</narrative>
  </description>
