  <participating-org role="4" type="24">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YGOAL Inc.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YGOAL is a social enterprise providing consultancy services specializing in program development, training and development and impact assessment. The organization was established in April 2013 whose founders are composed of professionals working with corporations,civil society organizations, and government.  YGOAL has a total of 55 consultants who are matched with the needs of the clients which include but are not limited to NGOs, academe, government agencies, local government, business sector and faith-based organizations

YGOAL is ENABLING ORGANIZATIONS.  It is creating a stronger affinity between organizations and the communities they serve by conceptualizing programs that enable organizations to meet certain needs and fulfill their objectives.

YGOAL is ENGAGING PEOPLE.   It is all about engaging people and helping them improve their knowledge, skills and attitude by designing and conducting trainings thatare experiential in nature.

YGOAL is ACHIEVING RESULTS.  It is ensuring that programs are delivering real and tangible results andthat it have mechanisms that identifies potential areas for improvement and key learning points.</narrative>
  </participating-org>
